+# layers 40, variants ['fx1L', 'fx1Lb', 'np1L', 'ns1L'], shipped variant fx1L (ranks pooled, least squares rows 2-7)
+# fx1L: forward at 6 rows 34.656 ms (attention 10.322 + MoE 24.334), slope 3.1536 ms/row
+# fx1Lb: forward at 6 rows 34.707 ms (attention 10.333 + MoE 24.373), slope 3.1601 ms/row
