+# residuals: fitted forward vs the served round_ms (draft.zig) and the live round walls (todo.md:714)
+# rows  fitted  served  fit-served
+#    1   18.89    30.0    -11.11
+#    2   22.04    35.2    -13.16
+#    3   25.20    39.9    -14.70
+#    4   28.35    44.9    -16.55
